ps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e54e0f21-45f0-42a7-a125-9054937194d8\" />\n\nThat click will make the menu disappear, but it won't do anything else. You will have to click the button ('Setup' or 'Select') a second time for it to actually register.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[click bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24935516/click.bug.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115516/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115516/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}